message: "If you reference Jauria, cite this repository and the release you used."
type: software
title: "Jauria: Claude Code and Codex session manager for macOS"
authors:
  - name: "Jauria contributors"
repository-code: "https://github.com/StevenSantacruz56/jauria-sessions"
url: "https://github.com/StevenSantacruz56/jauria-sessions"
license: GPL-3.0-only
abstract: >-
  A Tauri and Rust desktop app for managing Claude Code, OpenAI Codex and
  zsh terminal sessions on macOS Apple Silicon, with separate Git worktrees
  for parallel tasks, local history, configurable concurrency, and two visible panes.
keywords:
  - claude-code
  - openai-codex
  - macos
  - tauri
  - rust
  - session-manager
  - git-worktree
